OL,3,GNEWSALandscape restoration planned
OL,4,Afollowing #9m sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 7,500 acres of peatland is to be
OL,7,Frestored following the #9m purchase of
OL,8,Fan area close to Kielder Forest, the
OL,9,Fbuyer has said.
OL,11,FEmblehope Estate in Northumberland has
OL,12,Fbeen bought by a group called Restore,
OL,13,Fwhich said it wants to re-wet degraded
OL,14,Fpeatland, restore lost botany and
OL,15,Fincrease vegetation diversity.
OL,17,FThe group, backed by private investment
OL,18,Fand banking partners, denied providing
OL,19,Fan opportunity for investors to
OL,20,Fgreenwash or offset their carbon
OL,21,Femissions.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
