OL,3,GNEWSALandscape restoration planned
OL,4,Afollowing #9m sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FFounder and director Benedict Macdonald
OL,7,Fsaid: "We are doing a more direct form
OL,8,Fof investment. This is a chance for
OL,9,Fbusinesses to invest in this project
OL,10,Fand it doesn't offset anything they are
OL,11,Fdoing elsewhere."
